@startuml
title Validation Release State
[*] --> SourceImplemented
SourceImplemented --> ValidationRunning : owner invokes harness
ValidationRunning --> ValidationFailed : any required stage fails
ValidationFailed --> Correcting : finding accepted
Correcting --> ValidationRunning : rerun
ValidationRunning --> OwnerValidated : all full-mode and live-preview stages pass
OwnerValidated --> ClaudeAuditPending : evidence packaged
ClaudeAuditPending --> AuditCorrections : Claude finds issue
AuditCorrections --> ValidationRunning : corrective rerun
ClaudeAuditPending --> ReadyForNextImplementation : audit accepted
@enduml
